(: Layer 6 — Meta-Cognition Module (Pure MeTTa/PLN, no LLM required)\n: Evaluates synthesis progress, checks claim consistency, flags gaps\n: Runs in <10ms locally as PLN inference over current state atoms\n\n(: Self-model seed atoms :)\n(|- ((--> oma metacognitive-agent) (stv 1.0 0.9)))\n(|- ((--> metacognitive-agent monitors-cognition) (stv 1.0 0.9)))\n(|- ((--> monitors-cognition detects-anomaly) (stv 0.85 0.8)))\n(|- ((--> detects-anomaly triggers-revision) (stv 0.80 0.7)))\n(|- ((--> triggers-revision updates-self-model) (stv 0.90 0.8)))\n(|- ((--> updates-self-model metacognitive-agent) (stv 0.95 0.85)))\n\n(: Monitoring predicates :)\n(|- ((--> oma checks-claim-consistency) (stv 0.85 0.7)))\n(|- ((--> oma flags-redundant-topic) (stv 0.80 0.6)))\n(|- ((--> oma detects-pivot-loop) (stv 0.90 0.75)))\n\n(: Revision actions :)\n(|- ((==> (--> oma detects-pivot-loop) (--> oma commits-topic)) (stv 0.85 0.8)))\n(|- ((==> (--> oma flags-redundant-topic) (--> oma websearch-fresh-topic)) (stv 0.80 0.7)))\n(|- ((==> (--> oma checks-claim-consistency) (--> oma pin-progress)) (stv 0.75 0.6)))\n\n(: Closed loop: anomaly -> revision -> self-model -> monitoring :)\n(: This IS the meta-cognitive cycle, no LLM pass needed :)